---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

// Welcome to Astro! Wondering what to do next? Check out the Astro documentation at https://docs.astro.build
// Don't want to use any of this? Delete everything in this file, the `assets`, `components`, and `layouts` directories, and start fresh.
---

<Layout>
	<section>
		<article class="mb-5">
			<h1>TED® Hair Restoration</h1>
			<p class="text-xl bg-[#EEE8E0] px-2">Post-Treatment Instructions</p>
		</article>
		<article>
			<div class="separation">
				<h2>What to Expect</h2>
				<p>	• Mild warmth <br>
					• Mild redness <br>
					• Temporary tingling <br>
					• Mild scalp tenderness <br>
					• Symptoms typically resolve within 24 hours. <br>
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="separation">
				<h2>Post-Treatment Care</h2>
				<p>	• Do not wash hair for 24 hours. <br>
					• Avoid hair coloring for 48 hours. <br>
					• Avoid styling products for 24 hours. <br>
					• Avoid strenuous exercise, hot tubs, and saunas for 24 hours. <br>
					• Protect your scalp from prolonged sun exposure. <br>
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="separation">
				<h2>Possible Side Effects</h2>
				<p>Most patients tolerate TED® Hair Restoration well. The following side effects are possible:</p>
			</div>

			<div class="separation">
				<h2>Common</h2>
				<p>	● Heating sensation: A mild warming sensation during or immediately after treatment is common and typically resolves within a few minutes. <br>
					● Erythema (redness): Mild redness of the scalp is expected and usually resolves within 24 hours. <br>
					● Mild scalp tenderness or sensitivity. <br>
					● Temporary tingling. <br>
					● Mild itching. <br>
					● Temporary dryness of the scalp. <br>
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="separation">
				<h2>Less Common</h2>
				<p>	● Temporary swelling. <br>
					● Temporary headache. <br>
					● Tinnitus (ringing in the ears): Although uncommon, some patients may experience temporary ringing in the ears following treatment. <br>
					● Mild discomfort lasting longer than expected. <br>
					● Temporary shedding before new hair growth begins (if applicable to your treatment protocol). <br>
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="separation">
				<h2>Contact kiwiMEDSPA Immediately</h2>
				<p>	• Severe pain <br>
					• Unexpected symptoms <br>
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="separation">
				<h2>Treatment Schedule</h2>
				<p>	• Minimum of 3 treatments every 4 weeks. <br>
					• Maintenance treatments may be recommended every 6–12 months. <br>
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="separation">
				<h2>Questions?</h2>
				<p>kiwiMEDSPA</p>
				<p>Medical Weight Loss &amp; Aesthetics</p>
				<p>Dr. Sergio Angel, MD</p>
				<p>Dr. Allie Angel, MD</p>
				<p>470-310-8155</p>
			</div>
		</article>
	</section>
</Layout>
